        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Name" STRING "Eagle-head" FIXED
            ^"Description" STRING "A Noldor brooch shaped like an eagle's head, celebrating the ancient alliance between the Elves and the Lord of Eagles. It stirs courage in battle and sharpens the eye for opportunity." FIXED
